1
00:00:07,749 --> 00:00:11,314
As I tie my laces up now I'm ready to go

2
00:00:11,601 --> 00:00:15,003
Even the wind seems to push me forward

3
00:00:15,586 --> 00:00:19,163
Using the light that shines through these kinds of doubt

4
00:00:19,542 --> 00:00:22,952
Let's chase all of those dreams that were long forgotten

5
00:00:23,302 --> 00:00:27,103
I can feel my heart racing with the beat

6
00:00:27,803 --> 00:00:31,503
Mixed with feelings of doubt and looking ahead

7
00:00:31,796 --> 00:00:34,994
Is everything really gonna be okay?

8
00:00:35,254 --> 00:00:40,802
So can we really make it out the other side?

9
00:00:41,103 --> 00:00:44,703
大丈夫だよ 見上げれば もう

10
00:00:45,086 --> 00:00:48,799
大丈夫ほら 七色の橋

11
00:00:49,076 --> 00:00:55,703
涙を流しきると 空に架かる

12
00:00:57,067 --> 00:01:00,902
ねぇ見えるでしょ はるか彼方に

13
00:01:01,084 --> 00:01:04,825
僕にも見える 君と同じの

14
00:01:05,049 --> 00:01:11,003
二つの空が いま一つになる

15
00:01:13,083 --> 00:01:19,802
やっと同じ空の下で 笑えるね

16
00:01:38,066 --> 00:01:41,703
We were born under two totally different skies

17
00:01:42,061 --> 00:01:45,003
Each star holds different memories for us

18
00:01:45,602 --> 00:01:49,402
You have many stories that of course are all your own

19
00:01:50,003 --> 00:01:52,703
And shed some tears that I don't know about

20
00:01:53,538 --> 00:01:57,010
On a day when I was smiling and was so carefree

21
00:01:58,203 --> 00:02:01,302
You could have been hurt or crying

22
00:02:01,550 --> 00:02:05,302
We might have felt the same types of joy

23
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:08,802
But the hard times we had are all on our own

24
00:02:09,043 --> 00:02:12,902
And all the promises we make to shape our future

25
00:02:13,607 --> 00:02:17,203
We decorate with words of hopes in our dreams

26
00:02:17,902 --> 00:02:20,802
You always hope for a better tomorrow

27
00:02:21,057 --> 00:02:26,502
And I know more than anything or anyone else

28
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:30,902
巡る季節のひとつのように

29
00:02:31,074 --> 00:02:34,814
悲しい時は 悲しいままに

30
00:02:35,035 --> 00:02:41,920
幸せになることを 急がないで

31
00:02:43,071 --> 00:02:46,862
大丈夫だよ ここにいるから

32
00:02:47,103 --> 00:02:50,833
大丈夫だよ どこにもいかない

33
00:02:51,062 --> 00:02:57,547
また走り出す時は 君といっしょ

34
00:03:16,072 --> 00:03:19,203
If there was ever a world that had no tears

35
00:03:20,066 --> 00:03:22,802
Would there even be a bridge to cross?

36
00:03:23,568 --> 00:03:27,203
You tried everything you could to numb the pain

37
00:03:28,002 --> 00:03:30,802
Afraid of getting wet from the rain

38
00:03:32,203 --> 00:03:35,902
You tried to build a bridge by simply running away

39
00:03:36,053 --> 00:03:39,703
From all the troubles that followed you

40
00:03:40,079 --> 00:03:43,802
But now you throw away your umbrella

41
00:03:43,832 --> 00:03:47,002
And simply close your eyes

42
00:03:48,802 --> 00:03:49,203
(大丈夫)

43
00:03:50,002 --> 00:03:52,703
大丈夫だよ 見上げれば もう

44
00:03:53,067 --> 00:03:56,786
大丈夫ほら 七色の橋

45
00:03:57,046 --> 00:04:04,203
涙を流し終えた君の空に

46
00:04:04,751 --> 00:04:08,938
ねぇ見えるでしょ 色鮮やかに

47
00:04:09,074 --> 00:04:12,862
僕にも見える 君と同じの

48
00:04:13,022 --> 00:04:19,832
絆という名の虹が架かったね

49
00:04:19,832 --> 00:04:27,663
そして 二つの空がやっと やっと 一つになって

50
00:04:28,051 --> 00:04:31,802
僕らを走らせるんだ

